DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggppiioocchhaarrggeerr driver provides support for battery chargers connected to
     GPIO pins.  Currently, only power supply status events are supported.

     The power supply status (connected or disconnected) is set up as a sensor
     and can be monitored using sysctl(8) or sensorsd(8).

